    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596487afad1018d3b49441bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "它们现在也在对我耳语，说只靠海洋之力\n是无法拯救世界的。还必须同时积蓄陆地之力，\n直捣鱿鱼的大本营……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1c6e813c99cd0dbc973702793e8be06828f4bd453793e158f596271e324dd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
