      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，海带它们计划收集太阳光做成光束，\n然后射向鱿鱼把它晒成干！是不是很兴奋啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd5fe207032444d33fdda95754450a393625bb52e53c31406f0b7008930d9b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
